(1)  160/    41A8 :                     ; Stray demo data is present here. It involves Sonic slowly running
(1)  161/    41A8 :                     ; right, jumping once, then running at full speed for a few seconds.
(1)  162/    41A8 :                     ; Interestingly, this lines up with our knowledge of the fabled
(1)  163/    41A8 :                     ; Tokyo Game Show prototype.
(1)  164/    41A8 :                     ; See it in action: https://youtu.be/S8_IAfQbUu0
