    6587/    C99A :                     ; Subroutine to make an object move and fall downward increasingly fast
    6588/    C99A :                     ; This moves the object horizontally and vertically
    6589/    C99A :                     ; and also applies gravity to its speed
    6590/    C99A :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    6591/    C99A :                     
    6592/    C99A :                     ; ||||||||||||||| S U B R O U T I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
