   12534/   1A604 :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   12535/   1A604 :                     ;
   12536/   1A604 :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   12537/   1A604 :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   12538/   1A604 :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   12539/   1A604 :                     ;
   12540/   1A604 :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   12541/   1A604 :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
   12542/   1A604 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
